This is the description and explaination of what was debugged and why.
/
1# issue: bool bullishCross = (fast[1] <= slow[1]) && (fast[0] > slow[0]);
/
The issue is that MQL5 CopyBuffer() places the older copied value first in the array.
The code assumes the opposite.
This means that the crossover condition is effectively checking for a bearish crossover instead of a bullish one.
/
1#: bool bullishCross = (fast[0] <= slow[0]) && (fast[1] > slow[1]);
/
This satisfies the complications.
